=== THE CERTIFIED COUNTEREXAMPLE ===
  v = [210, 1378, 1379, 2106, 2222, 2247, 3650, 3773, 4123, 5083, 5561, 5680, 6000]
  covering=True  ratio=28.57 (>13)  compressed=True  distinct=True
  not-detuned=True  diff-primitive=True  not-near-AP=True  max>=23=True
  => IsResidual = True
  min strictly-live q = 28   (fails EVERY q in [15,27])   => q<=27 is FALSE

  the decidable core (Lean-certifiable): for each q in [15,27], NO multiplier p is strictly-live:
    q=15: live multipliers = []
    q=16: live multipliers = []
    q=17: live multipliers = []
    q=18: live multipliers = []
    q=19: live multipliers = []
    q=20: live multipliers = []
    q=21: live multipliers = []
    q=22: live multipliers = []
    q=23: live multipliers = []
    q=24: live multipliers = []
    q=25: live multipliers = []
    q=26: live multipliers = []
    q=27: live multipliers = []

=== min q is UNBOUNDED: the naive adversary is excluded, but genuine residual families climb ===
  dilated APs c*{1..13} (the mu=0 locus) fail all q but have diff-gcd = c > 1 (NON-primitive):
    2*{1..13}: fails all q, diff-gcd=2, residual=False
    4*{1..13}: fails all q, diff-gcd=4, residual=False
    6*{1..13}: fails all q, diff-gcd=6, residual=False
  but genuine residual families reach:
    max(min q) found = 37   at [4128, 9747, 15709, 23210, 28826, 41455, 45900, 54219, 61330, 65079, 89102, 95291, 98455]

CONSEQUENCE: BoundedStrictlyLiveSupply B is FALSE for every fixed B. The correct obligation is
StrictlyLiveSupply (B = infinity) / the measure floor. klein's THM-685 transfer (live rulers at
q > Sum v/mu) is LOAD-BEARING, not a superfluous safety net -- the near-tight residual families
genuinely need large q. The S127cont9 'witness lives at the bottom' holds for GENERIC families only.
